WEBVTT

00:00:02.591 --> 00:00:03.884
(groans)

00:00:03.967 --> 00:00:06.637
Yoo-hoo! You ready for
your big speech, honeyfangs?

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:08.680
Yes, I think so.

00:00:08.764 --> 00:00:13.352
But (groans) Johnny is
giving me the greatest headache

00:00:13.435 --> 00:00:15.646
of my entire existence right now,

00:00:15.729 --> 00:00:19.483
like a giant wooden stake
right through my brain!

00:00:19.566 --> 00:00:20.692
Oh, you know Johnny.

00:00:20.776 --> 00:00:22.236
He just gets a little carried away.

00:00:22.319 --> 00:00:23.987
Yes, exactly.

00:00:24.071 --> 00:00:25.280
And ruins everything.

00:00:25.364 --> 00:00:26.657
That's the problem.

00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:28.951
Well, you're gonna have to
get used to things being done

00:00:29.034 --> 00:00:31.036
a little differently around here
when you retire.

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:32.121
Shh!

00:00:32.204 --> 00:00:35.499
(echoing):
...when you retire.

00:00:35.582 --> 00:00:37.126
Retire?

00:00:37.209 --> 00:00:38.544
DRACULA:
Not so loud.

00:00:38.627 --> 00:00:40.337
Mavis has supersonic hearing.

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:41.588
ERICKA:
Why would she be listening?

00:00:41.672 --> 00:00:43.257
Don't be so paranoid.

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:45.717
Yes, I-I'm sure you're right.

00:00:45.801 --> 00:00:49.930
I just... (sighs) I don't want
anything else to go wrong.

00:00:50.013 --> 00:00:52.266
Everything has to be perfect

00:00:52.349 --> 00:00:55.894
when I finally give the hotel to Mavis.

00:00:55.978 --> 00:00:57.521
What?!

00:00:57.604 --> 00:00:59.022
And Johnny.

00:00:59.106 --> 00:01:00.899
Yes, and Johnny.

00:01:00.983 --> 00:01:03.152
Oh, it is a big step.

00:01:03.235 --> 00:01:05.988
I know how much this hotel means to you.

00:01:06.071 --> 00:01:10.367
Ah, yes, but it is time to let go

00:01:10.450 --> 00:01:13.704
and start a new chapter, together.

00:01:13.787 --> 00:01:17.207
Well, you are just all sorts
of wonderful, aren't you?

00:01:17.291 --> 00:01:21.503
Well, it's not for nothing
that they call me

00:01:21.587 --> 00:01:23.463
Count Wonderful.

00:01:23.547 --> 00:01:25.632
Oh. Do they?

00:01:25.716 --> 00:01:28.969
(singsongy): And also
Dark Prince of Loveliness.

00:01:29.052 --> 00:01:30.387
Mm-hmm.

00:01:30.470 --> 00:01:33.182
Lord of Smoochy Time.

00:01:33.265 --> 00:01:34.433
-(Dracula smooching)
-(Ericka giggles)

00:01:34.516 --> 00:01:36.101
ERICKA:
Oh, stop it, Drac.

00:01:36.185 --> 00:01:37.311
(groaning)

00:01:37.394 --> 00:01:40.147
Ew, ew. Ew-ew-ew-ew-ew-ew.
(shudders)

00:01:40.230 --> 00:01:41.857
Whoa, cute ear, hon.

00:01:41.940 --> 00:01:43.692
Holy rabies. Holy rabies!

00:01:43.775 --> 00:01:45.068
You're never gonna believe it!

00:01:45.152 --> 00:01:46.528
What? What's going on?

00:01:46.612 --> 00:01:49.156
Johnny, you better sit down for this.

00:01:49.239 --> 00:01:50.908
Babe, you're freaking me out here.

00:01:50.991 --> 00:01:53.327
(gasps) Dad is gonna retire

00:01:53.410 --> 00:01:55.495
and leave us the hotel!

00:01:57.998 --> 00:02:00.918
(stifled grunting)

00:02:01.001 --> 00:02:03.879
(rapid grunting)

00:02:03.962 --> 00:02:06.423
-(whooping)
-(crowd gasps)

00:02:06.506 --> 00:02:08.217
He's okay. He's okay.

00:02:08.300 --> 00:02:10.260
Just a-a little too much sugar.

00:02:10.344 --> 00:02:11.595
Whoa.

00:02:11.678 --> 00:02:13.722
I didn't even know
he was thinking of retiring.

00:02:13.805 --> 00:02:15.265
Shh. Neither did I.

00:02:15.349 --> 00:02:17.768
Oh, my gosh, Mavis, I'm so happy for you.

00:02:17.851 --> 00:02:19.436
You're gonna be amazing!

00:02:19.519 --> 00:02:21.605
You mean we're going to be amazing.

00:02:21.688 --> 00:02:24.024
Dad's leaving the hotel to both of us.

00:02:24.107 --> 00:02:25.317
Really?

00:02:25.400 --> 00:02:26.526
Both of us?

00:02:26.610 --> 00:02:27.694
Are you sure?

00:02:27.778 --> 00:02:29.613
Of course. Why wouldn't he?

00:02:29.696 --> 00:02:31.531
Oh, uh, I don't know.

00:02:31.615 --> 00:02:33.867
I-I guess I just never got the feeling

00:02:33.951 --> 00:02:36.286
that he really thought of me as, you know,

00:02:36.370 --> 00:02:37.746
part of the family.

00:02:37.829 --> 00:02:39.915
What are you talking about?

00:02:39.998 --> 00:02:41.500
Of course you're part of the family.

00:02:41.583 --> 00:02:46.922
No, I know, but you know
how Cranky Fangs is sometimes.

00:02:47.005 --> 00:02:50.425
I mean, it feels like I am,
but not really.

00:02:50.509 --> 00:02:51.718
That's not true.

00:02:51.802 --> 00:02:53.679
Well, not anymore it isn't!

00:02:53.762 --> 00:02:55.013
-(whoops)
-Shh. (chuckles)

00:02:55.097 --> 00:02:56.890
We can't spoil the surprise.

00:02:56.974 --> 00:02:58.934
Right. Right, right, right,
right, right, right.

00:02:59.017 --> 00:03:01.144
(shudders excitedly)
I better walk this off.

00:03:01.228 --> 00:03:03.105
Hey, how's it going? Nothing to see.

00:03:03.188 --> 00:03:05.357
Nothing much to talk about,
except for the greatest thing

00:03:05.440 --> 00:03:07.442
happening in the entire universe.
(gasps)

00:03:07.526 --> 00:03:09.403
Oh, oh, there he is.

00:03:09.486 --> 00:03:11.071
Hey, Drac! Hey, Drac!

00:03:11.154 --> 00:03:12.614
Oh, no. No.

00:03:12.698 --> 00:03:14.032
Just keep it cool, Johnny.

00:03:14.116 --> 00:03:18.745
There will be plenty of time
to thank him after.

00:03:19.913 --> 00:03:21.456
(stifled grunting)

00:03:21.540 --> 00:03:23.500
(rapid grunting)

00:03:23.583 --> 00:03:24.835
(clears throat)

00:03:24.918 --> 00:03:26.461
All right, let's see here.

00:03:26.545 --> 00:03:29.673
Uh, dearest family, friends...
(clears throat)

00:03:29.756 --> 00:03:31.967
and, uh, and honored guests,

00:03:32.050 --> 00:03:35.512
I have started a new phase in my life,

00:03:35.595 --> 00:03:39.308
and I feel it is time
to begin a new chapter

00:03:39.391 --> 00:03:41.143
for Hotel Transylvania.

00:03:41.226 --> 00:03:44.563
So, I am extremely proud

00:03:44.646 --> 00:03:48.191
and honored to give
the key to the hotel to...

00:03:48.275 --> 00:03:50.360
Drac!

00:03:50.444 --> 00:03:51.862
I can't believe it. I can't believe it.

00:03:51.945 --> 00:03:53.572
I'm gonna explode into
a thousand little excited bits.

00:03:53.655 --> 00:03:55.407
And then those little excited bits
are gonna explode into

00:03:55.490 --> 00:03:57.200
millions of tiny little excited bits!

00:03:57.284 --> 00:03:59.536
-What?
-Oh, mighty king,

00:03:59.619 --> 00:04:03.332
it is with all my heart
that I accept this great honor.

00:04:03.415 --> 00:04:05.083
-Honor?
-With this mighty key,

00:04:05.167 --> 00:04:08.879
I will unlock the future
and usher in a new destiny

00:04:08.962 --> 00:04:11.590
for the great Hotel Transylvania!

00:04:11.673 --> 00:04:13.884
-Yeah?
-Oh! So many great ideas.

00:04:13.967 --> 00:04:16.053
I'm dizzy with hospitality creativity.

00:04:16.136 --> 00:04:17.596
-(groaning)
-Like horizontal escalators

00:04:17.679 --> 00:04:19.514
all through the lobby,
name tags for all guests

00:04:19.598 --> 00:04:21.099
for more casual relations,
green-energy-saving options...

00:04:21.183 --> 00:04:23.393
♪ ♪

00:04:23.477 --> 00:04:24.686
(grunting)

00:04:25.979 --> 00:04:28.732
...stationary bikes in every room
for your own power source.

00:04:28.815 --> 00:04:32.527
It's gonna be
the ultimate Johnny takeover!

00:04:32.611 --> 00:04:34.154
Yah!

00:04:34.237 --> 00:04:36.114
I can't do it!

00:04:36.198 --> 00:04:38.909
I thought I could give the hotel
to Mavis and Johnny,

00:04:38.992 --> 00:04:41.286
but he's going to ruin everything!

00:04:41.370 --> 00:04:43.080
(sobbing)

00:04:43.163 --> 00:04:45.290
I have to get out of this. I have to.

00:04:45.374 --> 00:04:46.583
I... I...

00:04:46.666 --> 00:04:47.667
Ah!

00:04:49.002 --> 00:04:52.422
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa,
Sir Johnny. (chuckles)

00:04:52.506 --> 00:04:55.884
I think that there has been
a misunderstanding.

00:04:55.967 --> 00:04:58.053
I actually...

00:04:58.136 --> 00:04:59.679
can't give you the hotel.

00:04:59.763 --> 00:05:02.307
-What?
-Yes, yes, yes, yes, yes.

00:05:02.391 --> 00:05:05.769
It is an old, very, very old,

00:05:05.852 --> 00:05:09.689
very ancient, very serious

00:05:09.773 --> 00:05:11.858
real estate law!

00:05:11.942 --> 00:05:15.028
-Real estate law?
-Yes, yes.

00:05:15.112 --> 00:05:16.822
It says,

00:05:16.905 --> 00:05:19.574
"No residence, whether it be
residential or commercial,

00:05:19.658 --> 00:05:22.536
"shall ever be transferred to,
owned by or inherited

00:05:22.619 --> 00:05:24.329
"to a human.

00:05:24.413 --> 00:05:27.249
"For if it did, to wit,
then that property shall be

00:05:27.332 --> 00:05:30.377
forfeited and repossessed unto it."

00:05:30.460 --> 00:05:33.755
Whoa. Those are some serious "its."

00:05:33.839 --> 00:05:36.508
I am truly sorry.

00:05:36.591 --> 00:05:39.469
I would absolutely love
to give you the hotel,

00:05:39.553 --> 00:05:43.056
but, you know,
you're not a monster, so can't.

00:05:43.140 --> 00:05:46.226
But then what's the big announcement?

00:05:46.309 --> 00:05:48.478
-Huh?
-(Blobby burbles)

00:05:48.562 --> 00:05:50.230
-(crowd cheering)
-(gasps, screams)

00:05:52.023 --> 00:05:54.234
Uh, uh...

00:05:54.317 --> 00:05:55.944
Excited for the big announcement?

00:05:56.027 --> 00:05:58.780
You have no idea. (chuckles)

00:05:58.864 --> 00:06:01.283
(through teeth):
Oh, think, think, think.

00:06:01.366 --> 00:06:03.493
Oh, you've got to announce something.

00:06:03.577 --> 00:06:05.620
(clears throat, gulps)

00:06:05.704 --> 00:06:06.705
(chuckles nervously)

00:06:06.788 --> 00:06:07.789
-(feedback squeals)
-(screams)

00:06:07.873 --> 00:06:09.249
(crowd gasps)

00:06:10.333 --> 00:06:12.711
There you are. You almost missed it.

00:06:12.794 --> 00:06:14.713
Uh-huh. (groans)

00:06:14.796 --> 00:06:15.839
(chuckles nervously)

00:06:15.922 --> 00:06:17.549
Uh... (clears throat)

00:06:17.632 --> 00:06:20.552
Uh, dearest friends and...

00:06:20.635 --> 00:06:22.053
(grunting clumsily)

00:06:22.137 --> 00:06:23.638
What is wrong with him?

00:06:23.722 --> 00:06:26.141
-Boy, is he nervous.
-This is hard to watch.

00:06:26.224 --> 00:06:27.559
GRIFFIN:
Get on with it!

00:06:27.642 --> 00:06:30.145
-Griffin!
-What? He's dying up there.

00:06:30.228 --> 00:06:34.107
I know, but you have to be respectful.

00:06:35.192 --> 00:06:38.195
Get on with it already!

00:06:38.278 --> 00:06:40.489
I... (grunting nervously)

00:06:40.572 --> 00:06:45.452
Dearest family, friends and, uh,
and honored guests,

00:06:45.535 --> 00:06:50.707
I... I have started
a new phase, uh, in my life.

00:06:50.790 --> 00:06:52.375
Here it comes.

00:06:52.459 --> 00:06:58.173
And I feel that now is the time for

00:06:58.256 --> 00:07:02.928
Hotel Transylvania to, um...

00:07:03.011 --> 00:07:05.388
uh... uh...

00:07:05.472 --> 00:07:06.556
(burbles)

00:07:06.640 --> 00:07:08.934
Oh. Expand!

00:07:09.017 --> 00:07:10.060
Yes!

00:07:10.143 --> 00:07:12.479
We are expanding the hotel!

00:07:12.562 --> 00:07:13.480
BOTH:
What?!

00:07:13.563 --> 00:07:14.814
Yes, yes.

00:07:14.898 --> 00:07:17.400
In order to address
the increasingly long lines,

00:07:17.484 --> 00:07:18.944
I am pleased to announce

00:07:19.027 --> 00:07:22.614
we will be adding
a new restroom to the lobby.

00:07:22.697 --> 00:07:24.824
(scattered applause)

00:07:24.908 --> 00:07:27.452
Can't never have enough bathrooms.

00:07:27.536 --> 00:07:29.955
But... (sighs)
but I thought I heard...

00:07:30.038 --> 00:07:33.375
(quietly):
Oh, man, this is all my fault.

00:07:33.458 --> 00:07:36.795
So, let's get on with the party!

00:07:36.878 --> 00:07:38.213
Take it away, Blobby!

